Progress/Status: 270 sub-contracts ($1.99 mill.) of rural road with 139.09 km in length were rehabilitated and/or 
repaired in 11 target provinces. 
Data Source: Government&amp;apos;s report 
Base year: 2011 
Baseline value: Y</narrative>
